  "title": "Cajun Spiced Corn",
  "description": "A great veggie side dish for any barbecue, spicy whole kernel corn is baked or grilled in a foil packet with onions, tomatoes, and green bell pepper.",
  "authors": [
    "Reynolds KitchensR"
  ],
